  "description": "With a handsome face and manners that would put a diplomat to shame, new hire Hyeon-U Lee is a sight for sore eyes to Senior Manager I-Yeon Shin when he walks through the doors of Hanshin Worldwide. Feeling like she’s won the lottery, I-Yeon is looking forward to her company life alongside this polite and hard-working young man— “Hey, I-Yeon. Get this done by tomorrow.” Hyeon-U is no regular employee; he’s the son of the CEO. And as he begins to show his true nasty nature behind closed doors, I-Yeon begins wondering what she did to deserve him. \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
